                        <li><a href="https://github.com/leynos/netsuke/blob/main/docs/translators-guide.md" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">Translator Guide (source)</a></li>
