                        <li><a href="https://cldr.unicode.org/index/cldr-spec/plural-rules" class="sidebar-link block px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-charcoal-mid hover:text-vermillion hover:bg-boxwood-light rounded-r-md transition-colors">CLDR Plural Rules</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
